      "value": "If your friend has a proper VRChat account they can go into the website and reset avatar there. Alternatively there is a VRChat helpdesk page that describes other ways to reset avatar. \n\nI guess to make this a proper feature/bug request, the VRChat client should try and load an avatar and if the performance is super bad without anything else (no world or other avatar) it should report the avatar and switch to a default automatically. Or not, just an idea I had.",
