  "details": "My friend and I had this problem where in an avatar they were in was lagging both of us out to the point of crashing our headsets. When they got back on vr the lag was still there. The lag was so bad that they couldn’t change avatars and each frame was taking 10 seconds to load. If there is a way you can fix the lag or at least help get my friend out of that avatar, please do so.",
